    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1976001331987919068",
      "url": "https://x.com/FCT_DRTS/status/1976001331987919068",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/FCT_DRTS/status/1976001331987919068",
      "text": "Traffic Advisory\nDay 13, Thursday 9th October, 2025\n\nConstruction of collector Road CN2 (Emmanuel I. Ogalla Street from Aterial Road N16 (Yemi Osinbajo Way) to N20 (Wole Soyinka Way) including Road ILS 5 within Katampe District.\n\nThis is to again inform the FCT motoring public of staggered movement in traffic flow during movement of dignitaries to Emmanuel Ogalla Street along Wole Soyinka Road (Next Cash 'n' Carry junction, before Living Faith Church, Katampe), venue of the event.\n\nAlternative Route:\nMotorists resident at Camellia Court, Emirate Prime Apt, and other nearby locations, can use Attom Gujja Crescent Way to connect to the Expressway on Yemi Osinbajo Way, as Emmanuel Ogalla Street, Katampe District will be closed and only be accessible by those attending the flag-off event.\n\nTraffic and security personnel will be deployed accordingly to direct and control traffic for seamless movement at 0700hrs.\n\nYour usual cooperation is highly solicited.\n\n- Head Traffic, DRTS",
